{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>לכל עמו.</b> Upon them too he decreed (Sotah 12). On the day Moses was born, his astrologers told him: Today the savior of Israel has been born, and we do not know whether from Egypt or from Israel, but we see that he is destined to be struck by water. Therefore on that day he decreed even upon the Egyptians, as it is said ״כָּל הַבֵּן הַיִּלּוֹד״ — and it is not said הַיִּלּוֹד לָעִבְרִים; and they did not know that he was destined to be struck at the waters of Merivah."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:08.643659379Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}